Package: ppabr
Title: Data from the Multi-Year Plans of the Brazilian States
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("João Vitor", "Bezerra",, "joabezcs@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("INCT Labplan", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Provides access to data extracted from the Multi-Year Plans
    ('Planos Plurianuais', PPA) of the 26 Brazilian states and the Federal
    District, covering the planning cycles from 2008-2011 to 2024-2027.
    Besides the tables of each plan as extracted from the official
    documents, it offers harmonized layers with the same columns across
    states and cycles (programs, actions, indicators, goals and budget
    values in Brazilian reais) and the text of each page of the original
    documents, so that the plans can be used as text data. Files are
    downloaded on demand from a public repository
    <https://github.com/joabezcs/ppabr> and cached locally.
